* 7-bit SAR ADC core for 1F1C (Laleni et al. 2024, Fig. 9), PTM 32nm LP, VDD = 1 V.
* Conventional switching, single-ended, bottom-plate sampling, comparator vs VCM.
* All gates are minimum size (L = 32 nm, Wn = 48 nm, Wp = 96 nm) unless noted.

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- basic gates
.subckt inv a y vdd
Mp y a vdd vdd pmos W=96n L=32n
Mn y a 0   0   nmos W=48n L=32n
.ends

.subckt nand2 a b y vdd
Mp1 y a vdd vdd pmos W=96n L=32n
Mp2 y b vdd vdd pmos W=96n L=32n
Mn1 y a n1  0   nmos W=96n L=32n
Mn2 n1 b 0  0   nmos W=96n L=32n
.ends

.subckt nor2 a b y vdd
Mp1 n1 a vdd vdd pmos W=192n L=32n
Mp2 y  b n1  vdd pmos W=192n L=32n
Mn1 y a 0 0 nmos W=48n L=32n
Mn2 y b 0 0 nmos W=48n L=32n
.ends

* transmission gate: conducts when en = 1 (enb = not en)
.subckt tg x y en enb vdd W=96n
Mn x en  y 0   nmos W={W} L=32n
Mp x enb y vdd pmos W={W} L=32n
.ends

* low-Vt transmission gate for analog switches (DAC, sampling):
* standard-Vt LP devices (Vth ~0.55 V) barely conduct at mid-rail (Vref = 0.5 V)
.subckt tglvt x y en enb vdd W=192n
Mn x en  y 0   nmos_lvt W={W} L=32n
Mp x enb y vdd pmos_lvt W={W} L=32n
.ends

* positive-edge master-slave DFF (transmission-gate latches)
.subckt dff d clk q vdd
Xi0 clk clkb vdd inv
* master: transparent while clk = 0
Xt1 d a clkb clk vdd tg
Xi1 a b vdd inv
Xi2 b c vdd inv
Xt2 c a clk clkb vdd tg
* slave: transparent while clk = 1
Xt3 b e clk clkb vdd tg
Xi3 e q vdd inv
Xi4 q g vdd inv
Xt4 g e clkb clk vdd tg
.ends

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- comparator
* PMOS-input StrongARM latch (inputs near ground: VCM = 0.3 V).
* Evaluates while clkc = 1, resets (outputs to ground) while clkc = 0.
* outn rises when inp < inn; outp rises when inp > inn.
* NOR SR latch holds the decision: cmp = 1  <=>  inp < inn.
.subckt comparator inp inn clkc cmp vdd
Xic clkc clkcb vdd inv
Mtail t clkcb vdd vdd pmos W=2u L=32n
M1 p inp t vdd pmos W=2u L=64n
M2 q inn t vdd pmos W=2u L=64n
M3 outn outp p vdd pmos W=1u L=32n
M4 outp outn q vdd pmos W=1u L=32n
M5 outn outp 0 0 nmos W=500n L=32n
M6 outp outn 0 0 nmos W=500n L=32n
M7 outn clkcb 0 0 nmos W=250n L=32n
M8 outp clkcb 0 0 nmos W=250n L=32n
M9 p clkcb 0 0 nmos W=250n L=32n
M10 q clkcb 0 0 nmos W=250n L=32n
Xn1 outp cmpb cmp vdd nor2
Xn2 outn cmp cmpb vdd nor2
.ends

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- one DAC bit
* bottom plate bot of this bit's capacitor:
*   samp = 1 -> vin ; samp = 0 and dk = 1 -> vref ; samp = 0 and dk = 0 -> ground
.subckt dacsw bot vin vref samp sampb dk vdd W=192n
Xi dk dkb vdd inv
Xnr samp dkb enref vdd nor2
Xng samp dk  engnd vdd nor2
Xir enref enrefb vdd inv
Xtin vin  bot samp  sampb  vdd tglvt W={W}
Xtrf vref bot enref enrefb vdd tglvt W={W}
Mg bot engnd 0 0 nmos_lvt W={W} L=32n
.ends

* ---------------------------------------------------------------- one SAR bit
* tk  : this bit's trial cycle (one-hot from the shift register)
* bk  : decided bit (register)
* dk  : DAC control = tk OR bk
* next bk = samp ? 0 : (tk ? cmp : bk)
.subckt sarbit tk cmp samp clk bk dk vdd
Xit tk tkb vdd inv
Xtm1 cmp mux tk tkb vdd tg
Xtm2 bk  mux tkb tk vdd tg
Xim mux muxb vdd inv
Xnd samp muxb bnext vdd nor2
Xff bnext clk bk vdd dff
Xor tk bk dkn vdd nor2
Xio dkn dk vdd inv
.ends
